_sase-org__sase","cl_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC sase-k3[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]ACE startup — take badge classification, hidden-row repair, and a [/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]         [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]double ProjectSpec parse off first paint[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]Warm `sase ace` time-to-interactive drops from roughly 3.5–4 s to [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]under 2 s on athena, the part of startup that grows with every [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]dismissed agent stops growing, and a durable startup telemetry [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]record makes both claims checkable in a real terminal instead of [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]modelled from component measurements.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]6[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plans:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]ace_startup_critical_path.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202608/ace_startup_critical_path.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-k3[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-k3/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Durable startup telemetry[/bold #D7AFFF]                                     [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]telemetry[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]telemetry: record one JSONL row per ACE session carrying both a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]visible-surface-ready and an all-surfaces-ready time plus the component [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]budget, make the loader-stage log threshold env-overridable so sub-2 s [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]stages are capturable, and document the before/after capture recipe.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Two module-level import defects[/bold #D7AFFF]                               [bold black on #5FD7AF] xsmall [/bold black on #5FD7AF]\n    [#AF87FF]imports[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]imports: move the `sase.axe.state` import in toast_log out of module [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]scope, drop the module-level `unittest.mock` import from the Patch [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]loader in favor of a sys.modules-guarded check, and add a subprocess [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]import-graph guard test.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Deferred persisted diff-badge classification[/bold #D7AFFF]                  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]badges[dim] · [dim][/dim]after telemetry[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]badges: stop classifying persisted diff badges inside the loader's [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]status-override pass and compute them for visible rows only in a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]coalesced background pass modeled on the existing bead-warmup and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]live-hint mixins, with carry-over across reloads so badges do not [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]flicker on refresh.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Read-only freshness policy for ACE's Tier-1 index query[/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]repair[dim] · [dim][/dim]after telemetry[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]repair: add a freshness knob to the artifact-index query wire in [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sase-core so ACE's startup and auto-refresh queries skip hidden-row [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]repair and per-row marker revalidation, stop selecting record_json in [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]refresh_stale_rows, and run one coalesced revalidating reconcile after [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]first paint on a long cadence.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]AXE collect stops parsing every ProjectSpec twice[/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]axe[dim] · [dim][/dim]after telemetry[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]axe: route the two global runner counters through one shared cached [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Patch snapshot instead of two uncached full-archive parses, and end the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]startup stopwatch on the initially visible tab so a future hidden-tab [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]feature cannot silently regress every startup mode.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Land the epic[/bold #D7AFFF]                                                 [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]land[dim] · [dim][/dim]after telemetry, imports, badges, repair, axe[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]land: re-measure the full budget in a real terminal against the phase [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`telemetry` baseline, file the named follow-ups with /sase_new_task, and[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]close the epic with an honest reading of what each phase bought.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-k3","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.5","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-k3.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-9d11b95d7d9d35252f6dcc4a005b8c35","started_at":"2026-08-12T15:47:39.390499+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[{"committed_at":1786556015,"sha":"2d92ef6a92762eb07948d64c0b91f95491827829","subject":"feat(ace,axe): share one cached Patch snapshot for runner counts, gate startup stopwatch on the visible tab (sase-k3.5)"}],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"f3e8269089303e54ba2d8014dc8dd572844b92130afc731709c369d436d5221f","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-k3.5/chat.md","size_bytes":7971},"commits":{"digest":"8d77a